{"seq":2,"slug":"scaling-agents","title":"Agent 扩展与性能优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/production-deployment/scaling-agents","wordCount":963,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"agent-扩展与性能优化\">Agent 扩展与性能优化</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Agent 系统的扩展面临独特的挑战——LLM 调用的高延迟、不确定的执行时间和高昂的 Token 成本使得传统的 Web 扩展策略不能直接照搬。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三层优化框架\">三层优化框架</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层面</th>\n<th>优化目标</th>\n<th>典型手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>推理层</td>\n<td>减少 LLM 调用次数和 Token 消耗</td>\n<td>Prompt 压缩、模型降级、缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编排层</td>\n<td>并行化和缓存</td>\n<td>并行工具调用、流式、异步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基础设施层</td>\n<td>负载均衡和弹性伸缩</td>\n<td>负载均衡、队列削峰</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[Prompt 压缩]--&gt;D[并行工具调用]&#10;    B[模型降级]--&gt;D&#10;    C[缓存命中]--&gt;D&#10;    D--&gt;G[负载均衡]&#10;    E[流式输出]--&gt;G&#10;    F[异步处理]--&gt;G&#10;    G--&gt;H[弹性伸缩]\">flowchart TD\n    A[Prompt 压缩]--&gt;D[并行工具调用]\n    B[模型降级]--&gt;D\n    C[缓存命中]--&gt;D\n    D--&gt;G[负载均衡]\n    E[流式输出]--&gt;G\n    F[异步处理]--&gt;G\n    G--&gt;H[弹性伸缩]</pre><h3 id=\"优化策略全景\">优化策略全景</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化策略</th>\n<th>影响维度</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Prompt 缓存</td>\n<td>延迟+成本</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>重复查询场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语义缓存</td>\n<td>延迟+成本</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>相似查询场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型路由</td>\n<td>成本</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>混合复杂度任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流式处理</td>\n<td>用户体验</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>所有对话场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异步队列</td>\n<td>吞吐量</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>批处理场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型蒸馏</td>\n<td>延迟+成本</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>垂直领域</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"语义缓存\">语义缓存</h2><p>语义缓存通过向量相似度判断查询是否可以复用历史结果，避免重复的 LLM 调用。与精确匹配缓存不同，语义缓存能够处理措辞不同但含义相同的查询。</p>\n<h3 id=\"查找逻辑\">查找逻辑</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"get: async (query: string) =&gt; {&#10;  const qe = await embed(query);&#10;  for (const e of fresh(entries)) {&#10;    const s = cosine(qe, e.embedding);&#10;    if (s &gt; threshold &amp;&amp; s &gt; best) {&#10;      hit = e;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;  return hit?.response ?? null;&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">query</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> qe</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> embed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(query);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fresh</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(entries)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> cosine</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(qe, e.embedding);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> threshold </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> best) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      hit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hit?.response </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"淘汰策略\">淘汰策略</h3><ul>\n<li>写入时若超过 <code>maxEntries</code>，按 <code>hitCount</code> 排序淘汰命中最少的条目</li>\n<li>每个条目带时间戳，过期（超过 <code>ttlMs</code>）的条目在查找时跳过</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"阈值调优\">阈值调优</h3><p>语义缓存的关键参数是<strong>相似度阈值</strong>，通常建议从 0.95 开始，根据实际效果逐步调整：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阈值设置</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>过低</td>\n<td>错误命中，返回不相关的缓存结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过高</td>\n<td>缓存命中率下降</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"模型路由与降级\">模型路由与降级</h2><p>模型路由根据查询复杂度自动选择合适的模型，简单查询使用快速便宜的小模型，复杂查询使用能力强但昂贵的大模型。</p>\n<h3 id=\"复杂度分类规则\">复杂度分类规则</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号</th>\n<th>判定</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>含代码块、多个问句、长推理请求</td>\n<td>complex</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>含推理词（为什么/分析/比较/设计）或长度 &gt;100</td>\n<td>medium</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>其余短查询</td>\n<td>simple</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"路由与降级实现\">路由与降级实现</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const modelMap = {&#10;  simple: models.fast,&#10;  medium: models.balanced,&#10;  complex: models.powerful,&#10;};&#10;try {&#10;  return await call(complexity);&#10;} catch {&#10;  return callPowerful();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> modelMap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  simple: models.fast,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  medium: models.balanced,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  complex: models.powerful,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> call</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(complexity);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> callPowerful</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"分类精度的提升路径\">分类精度的提升路径</h3><p>模型路由的核心挑战是<strong>复杂度分类的准确性</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分类器形态</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基于规则</td>\n<td>简单但不够准确</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>轻量级分类模型</td>\n<td>训练后可提高路由精度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"异步处理与队列\">异步处理与队列</h2><p>对于耗时较长的 Agent 任务，同步等待会导致连接超时和资源浪费。异步队列模式将任务提交和结果获取分离。</p>\n<h3 id=\"任务生命周期\">任务生命周期</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[submit 提交]--&gt;B[pending 排队]&#10;    B--&gt;C[processing 执行]&#10;    C--&gt;D[completed 完成]&#10;    C--&gt;E[failed 失败]\">flowchart TD\n    A[submit 提交]--&gt;B[pending 排队]\n    B--&gt;C[processing 执行]\n    C--&gt;D[completed 完成]\n    C--&gt;E[failed 失败]</pre><h3 id=\"队列实现要点\">队列实现要点</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const processNext = async () =&gt; {&#10;  if (busy() || pending.length === 0) {&#10;    return;&#10;  }&#10;  const job = takeNext();&#10;  job.status = &#39;processing&#39;;&#10;  try {&#10;    job.result = await run(job);&#10;    job.status = &#39;completed&#39;;&#10;  } catch {&#10;    job.status = &#39;failed&#39;;&#10;  } finally {&#10;    release();&#10;    processNext();&#10;  }&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> processNext</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">busy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pending.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> job</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> takeNext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  job.status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'processing'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    job.result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(job);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    job.status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'completed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    job.status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'failed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">finally</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    release</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    processNext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"对外接口\">对外接口</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>接口</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>submit(input)</code></td>\n<td>入队并返回 job id</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>getStatus(id)</code></td>\n<td>查询单个任务状态与结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>getQueueStats()</code></td>\n<td>查看排队/执行中/总数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"流式输出优化\">流式输出优化</h2><p>流式输出让用户在 Agent 推理过程中就能看到部分结果，显著改善感知延迟。</p>\n<h3 id=\"实现形态\">实现形态</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"return async function* (input) {&#10;  let full = &#39;&#39;;&#10;  for await (const c of stream(input)) {&#10;    full += c.content;&#10;    yield token(c.content);&#10;  }&#10;  yield complete(full);&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">input</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> full </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> stream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(input)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    full </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.content;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    yield</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> token</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(c.content);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  yield</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> complete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(full);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"三种流式策略\">三种流式策略</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>流式策略</th>\n<th>粒度</th>\n<th>延迟改善</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Token 级流式</td>\n<td>每个 Token</td>\n<td>最大</td>\n<td>文本生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>步骤级流式</td>\n<td>每个工具调用</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>Agent 工作流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合流式</td>\n<td>Token + 状态</td>\n<td>最大</td>\n<td>复杂交互</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Agent 扩展需要在推理层、编排层和基础设施层三个层面协同优化</li>\n<li>语义缓存通过向量相似度避免重复 LLM 调用，阈值设置影响准确性和命中率的平衡</li>\n<li>模型路由根据查询复杂度自动选择模型，在成本和质量之间取得平衡</li>\n<li>异步队列将任务提交和结果获取分离，适合处理耗时 Agent 任务</li>\n<li>流式输出是改善用户体验最直接的手段，应在所有对话场景中默认启用</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Agent 扩展与性能优化","id":"agent-扩展与性能优化"},{"level"